---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Affiliate disclosure" description="How Heat Pump Wise makes money.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <article class="post">
      <h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
      <p>If you buy something through a link on this site, I may earn a commission. The price you pay is the same regardless. The commission comes out of the retailer's margin, not your total.</p>
      <h2>Which links</h2>
      <p>Heat pump units and accessories sold through retailers (SupplyHouse, Ferguson, Alpine, Amazon for small fittings). Tools I personally own and have written about. Books.</p>
      <h2>Which links do not pay</h2>
      <p>Manufacturer direct links, government rebate pages, trade association resources, utility calculators. I link to those because they are useful, not because they pay.</p>
      <h2>The rule</h2>
      <p>If a brand offers me money to write a positive review, the answer is no. If I write a negative review of a brand that also pays me commission on unrelated products at a retailer, the negative review stands.</p>
      <p>Treat this site as a useful stranger on a forum who happens to have bought the thing first. Read accordingly.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>